    <code code="10187-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Review of systems Narrative - Reported"/>
    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Positive</td><td>Cough with morning sputum; one more streak of blood since the first visit; no breathlessness at rest</td></tr><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Night sweats and evening fevers; poor appetite</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No tendon or joint pain</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No numbness or tingling; fine finger movements normal</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Anxious and low, but relieved to know the diagnosis; no thoughts of suicide or self-harm</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

